startup: idle editor prompt + offline footer
held: working indicator + partial "offline " rendered before completion
steer: queued line echoed while the turn stayed busy
abort: Escape (app.interrupt) cleared the working indicator and returned the editor
reply: "offline acceptance" rendered after a real typed prompt, idle
resize: 120 -> 160 columns, overflow=false
theme: fallback diagnostic observed=true
quit: Ctrl+C x2 -> exit 0
